" width="842.0" height="222.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ixc6" value="&lt;b&gt;UML: component and package  ·  2&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#C2410C;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C2410C;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1058.0" width="842.0" height="130.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ixc7" value="&lt;b&gt;UML: object  ·  2&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#15803D;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#15803D;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="922.0" y="1134.0" width="842.0" height="130.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ixc8" value="&lt;b&gt;Flow and block diagrams  ·  15&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#BE185D;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BE185D;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1212.0" width="842.0" height="314.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ixc9" value="&lt;b&gt;Data flow  ·  11&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4338CA;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4338CA;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="922.0" y="1288.0" width="842.0" height="268.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ixc10" value="&lt;b&gt;ER (database)  ·  14&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#334155;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1550.0" width="842.0" height="314.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ixc1_p" value="Phase 1 · Foundations. Who owns which class, bordered by role. Inheritance, layers, permission matrices and one slice per role." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#64748B;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="34.0" width="806.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><object id="ix_B01" label="B01  Class territories: who owns which class" link="data:page/id,pg_B01" tooltip="Every class has one home role; the border colour tells you who is responsible for it"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="74.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B02" label="B02  What inherits what" link="data:page/id,pg_B02" tooltip="One parent gives the same columns and the same life-cycle to many children"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="290.0" y="74.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B03" label="B03  Layers: who may call whom" link="data:page/id,pg_B03" tooltip="Calls travel one way: screen, entry point, service, data access, outside world"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="562.0" y="74.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B04a" label="B04a  Permission matrix, part 1: content, engagement,&lt;br&gt;structure, events" link="data:page/id,pg_B04a" tooltip="Class by role: who can create, read, change, publish, approve, export or submit"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="120.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B04b" label="B04b  Permission matrix, part 2: Go Ye, giving, new&lt;br&gt;member, identity" link="data:page/id,pg_B04b" tooltip="Class by role: who can create, read, change, publish, approve, export or submit"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="290.0" y="120.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B05" label="B05  What is the main class? Counting who depends on&lt;br&gt;whom" link="data:page/id,pg_B05" tooltip="Fan-in (how many tables point at a class) and fan-out (how many classes a table points at)"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="562.0" y="120.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B06" label="B06  Module dependencies: the kernel and the six feature&lt;br&gt;modules" link="data:page/id,pg_B06" tooltip="Arrows point from the module that depends to the module it depends on; numbers count the foreign keys"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="166.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B07" label="B07  Synergy: seven threads that tie the classes together" link="data:page/id,pg_B07" tooltip="Each row is a story that crosses roles; the border colour of each box shows who owns that step"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="290.0" y="166.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B08" label="B08  The translation pattern: one entity, one row per&lt;br&gt;language" link="data:page/id,pg_B08" tooltip="How blogs, sermons and every other text can exist in English and Kiswahili"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="562.0" y="166.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B09" label="B09  Services: what they wrap, who calls them, what&lt;br&gt;happens when they fail" link="data:page/id,pg_B09" tooltip="Each outside tool is reached through one service so it can be replaced or can fail safely"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="212.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B10" labe