: the classes it owns, changes, submits and reads"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="350.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B19" label="B19  Role slice: Events Coordinator" link="data:page/id,pg_B19" tooltip="Events Coordinator: the classes it owns, changes, submits and reads"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc1"><mxGeometry x="290.0" y="350.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><mxCell id="ixc2_p" value="Phase 1 · Foundations. One tab per main class or service: attributes, methods, parents, children, dependants, access." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#64748B;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="ixc2"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="34.0" width="806.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><object id="ix_B20" label="B20  Tab: Better Auth core (User, Session, Account,&lt;br&gt;Verification)" link="data:page/id,pg_B20" tooltip="Attributes, parents, children, rules and mistakes"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc2"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="74.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_B21" label="B21  Tab: Staff access (StaffProfile, RoleAssignment,&lt;br&gt;AuditLog)" link="data:page/id,pg_B21" tooltip="Attributes, parents, children, rules and mistakes"><mxCell style="