ign-in, the role check every other process depends on, and the audit log"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4338CA;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc9"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="212.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_D11" label="D11  Process by store table: who reads and who writes" link="data:page/id,pg_D11" tooltip="The C-R-U-D table that shows what depends on what"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4338CA;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc9"><mxGeometry x="290.0" y="212.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><mxCell id="ixc10_p" value="Phase 1 · Foundations. Database design: conceptual, per-module, platform, translations, enums, Redis keys, constraints." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#64748B;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="ixc10"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="34.0" width="806.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><object id="ix_E01" label="E01  Conceptual ER: the whole church in 33 boxes" link="data:page/id,pg_E01" tooltip="Things and how they relate, without columns"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="ixc10"><mxGeometry x="18.0" y="74.0" width="262.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><object id="ix_E02" label="E02  ER: Identity and access" link="data:page/id,pg_E02" tooltip="Staff accounts, roles, scope, audit"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;fontCol