can change data; grey letters are read-only." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1144.0" width="900.0" height="44.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tnote1" value='These letters are not decoration. They are loaded into AuthzService, and a test fails the build if a role can do something this table does not allow (that is the "permission-matrix test" of gate G4).' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1198.0" width="900.0" height="32.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tnote2" value="Scope matters too. Branch, Editor, Treasurer, Discipler and Events act only inside their own branch; Department Leader only inside their own department; Super Admin and Translator are global (see&lt;br&gt;RoleAssignment in B20 and B21)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1240.0" width="900.0" height="44.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_t" value='&lt;b style="font-size:19px"&gt;B04a  ·  Permission matrix, part 1: content, engagement, structure, events&lt;/b&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000066;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="62.0" width="1070.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_s" value="Class architecture (UML)   |   Class by role: who can create, read, change, publish, approve, export or submit   