C create, R read, U update, D delete, P publish, A approve, X export, S submit)&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#64748B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=1;arcSize=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1165.0" width="1060.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeCohort_visitor" value="Visitor: R" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50.0" y="1193.0" width="64.3" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeCohort_newmember" value="New member: R" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="122.3" y="1193.0" width="95.6" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeCohort_super" value="Super: CRUD" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#E6E6F4;strokeColor=#000066;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="225.9" y="1193.0" width="83.3" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeCohort_branch" value="Branch: CRUD" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#ECEBFA;strokeColor=#4338CA;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="317.2" y="1193.0" width="89.5" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeCohort_discipler" value="Discipler: RU" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F2E7FB;strokeColor=#7E22CE;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="414.7" y="1193.0" width="82.8" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeCohort_events" value="Events: CRUD" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FBE6F0;strokeColor=#BE185D;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="505.4" y="1193.0" width="87.8" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1_Programme" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;Programme – in plain words&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The recipe. A cohort is one time you cook it.&lt;br&gt;A repeating course: Children 5 Days, CFC, Kairos, Teen 5 Days, New&lt;br&gt;Born Again. Says WHAT it is and HOW OFTEN.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#0369A1;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1255.0" width="337.3" height="84.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2_Programme" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;Rules the code must keep&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A programme has many cohorts over the years.&lt;br&gt;• A programme is the course (Kairos); a ProgrammeCohort is one run of&lt;br&gt;it (Kairos Jan-Mar 2027).&lt;br&gt;• Frequency text ("every Tuesday 6pm") is translatable.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#15803D;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="401.3" y="1255.0" width="337.3" height="84.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3_Programme" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;Mistakes to avoid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Mixing the course and the run. "Kairos 2027 Term 1" is a cohort, not a&lt;br&gt;programme.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762.7" y="1255.0" width="337.3" height="84.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1_ProgrammeCohort" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;ProgrammeCohort – in plain words&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One class intake.&lt;br&gt;One run of a programme at one branch: "CFC - Eastern Bypass - Oct&lt;br&gt;2026". Enrolment attaches to the cohort, not the programme.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#0369A1;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1361.0" width="337.3" height="84.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2_ProgrammeCohort" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;Rules the code must keep&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Visitors enrol in the NEXT OPEN cohort; the programme page shows&lt;br&gt;it automatically.&lt;br&gt;• status flow: planned -&amp;gt; open -&amp;gt; full/running -&amp;gt; completed (or&lt;br&gt;cancelled).' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#15803D;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="401.3" y="1361.0" width="337.3" height="84.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3_ProgrammeCohort" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;Mistakes to avoid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• None recorded beyond the shared mistakes on page B03.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762.7" y="1361.0" width="337.3" height="84.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gnote" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;How this group fits together&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Programme = the course. Cohort = one run of it with dates and capacity. People enrol in a cohort.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="1467.0" width="1060.0" height="46.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_t" value='&lt;b style="font-size:19px"&gt;B37  ·  Tab: Programme and cohort&lt;/b&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000066;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="52.0" width="910.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_s" value="Class tabs (UML detail)   |   Attributes, parents, children, rules and mistakes   |   Phase 1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#64748B;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="82.0" width="910.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><object id="bn_back" label='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;◀ Index&lt;/b&gt;' link="data:page/id,INDEX"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=#000066;strokeColor=#000066;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990.0" y="56.0" width="100.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object><mxCell id="edge0" value="departmentId" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BE185D;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=open;endFill=