tml=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#1B1B2F;" vertex="1" parent="c_Certificate"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="99.0" width="252.0" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="acc_ProgrammeEnrollment" value="&lt;b&gt;Who may do what on ProgrammeEnrollment   (C create, R read, U update, D delete, P publish, A approve, X export, S submit)&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#64748B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.2;rounded=1;arcSize=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="499.5" width="1060.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeEnrollment_visitor" value="Visitor: S" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50.0" y="527.5" width="63.7" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeEnrollment_newmember" value="New member: S" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="121.7" y="527.5" width="95.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeEnrollment_super" value="Super: RUX" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#E6E6F4;strokeColor=#000066;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="224.8" y="527.5" width="75.6" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeEnrollment_branch" value="Branch: RUX" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#ECEBFA;strokeColor=#4338CA;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="308.3" y="527.5" width="81.7" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeEnrollment_discipler" value="Discipler: CRU" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F2E7FB;strokeColor=#7E22CE;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="398.0" y="527.5" width="90.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ac_ProgrammeEnrollment_events" value="Events: RUDX" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FBE6F0;strokeColor=#BE185D;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;rounded=1;arcSize=50;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="496.0" y="527.5" width="87.2" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1_ProgrammeEnrollment" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;ProgrammeEnrollment – in plain words&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A name on the class register.&lt;br&gt;A person joining a cohort. The same class serves the web form, the Go&lt;br&gt;Ye hand-off and walk-ins.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F0F9FF;strokeColor=#0369A1;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="589.5" width="337.3" height="136.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2_ProgrammeEnrollment" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;Rules the code must keep&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• origin = go_ye or new_member links back to the Convert or journey&lt;br&gt;that caused it.&lt;br&gt;• Under-18 programmes require guardian fields.&lt;br&gt;• One person per cohort (unique on cohortId + contact).&lt;br&gt;• Status flow: requested -&amp;gt; confirmed -&amp;gt; attending -&amp;gt; completed |&lt;br&gt;dropped.&lt;br&gt;• No certificate column here: a Certificate points back to the enrollment,&lt;br&gt;not the other way round (breaks a circular dependency).' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#15803D;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="401.3" y="589.5" width="337.3" height="136.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3_ProgrammeEnrollment" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;Mistakes to avoid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Letting the same phone number enrol twice: it inflates numbers and&lt;br&gt;wastes a place.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762.7" y="589.5" width="337.3" height="136.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gnote" value='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;How this group fits together&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The link between a person and a cohort. A Convert can be enrolled in New Born Again from the follow-up screen.' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.3;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="747.5" width="1060.0" height="46.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_t" value='&lt;b style="font-size:19px"&gt;B38  ·  Tab: Programme enrolment&lt;/b&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000066;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="52.0" width="910.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_s" value="Class tabs (UML detail)   |   Attributes, parents, children, rules and mistakes   |   Phase 1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=H