permission tables (B04a and B04b) say which&lt;br&gt;person may do it." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1B1B2F;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;shape=note;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="470.0" width="900.0" height="44.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_t" value='&lt;b style="font-size:19px"&gt;D11  ·  Process by store table: who reads and who writes&lt;/b&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000066;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="62.0" width="1168.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bn_s" value="Data flow   |   The C-R-U-D table that shows what depends on what   |   Phase 1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#64748B;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=-2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="92.0" width="1168.0" height="30.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><object id="bn_back" label='&lt;b style="font-size:11px"&gt;◀ Index&lt;/b&gt;' link="data:page/id,INDEX"><mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=#000066;strokeColor=#000066;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;rounded=1;arcSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1248.0" y="66.0" width="100.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg_E01" name="E01 Conceptual ER: the whole church in 33 boxes"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2340" pageHeight="1286" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="mod_iam" value="&lt;b&gt;Identity &amp;amp; Access&lt;/b&gt;" style="